<title>USA: A.M. Castle &amp; Co Q1 net down, sales flat.</title>
<headline>A.M. Castle &amp; Co Q1 net down, sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN PARK, Ill. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Castle &amp; Co said Tuesday its earnings in the first quarter were hurt by a more competitive environment and higher costs.</p>
<p>The company reported lower earnings on slightly higher sales.</p>
<p>Company officials said the long-term outlook remains highly positive, considering its opportunities for growth and several initiatives to improve operating efficiencies.</p>
<p>A.M. Castle shares were off 1/8 at 17-3/4 Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
